ls for lower-level tasks\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"feedback-source\">— Hacker News</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback feedback-negative\">\n                            <div class=\"feedback-quote\">\"Users noting that new Opus 4.7 model has 7.5x requests in Pro+ but costs 4x more\"</div>\n                            <div class=\"feedback-source\">— Hacker News</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-header\">Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-header\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <div class=\"item-title\">\n                                <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Docker and Sandboxing AI Agents</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Discussion about securing AI agents through containerization and sandboxing techniques, addressing security concerns in agentic AI development.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">technical</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Software Engineering Daily</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">2025-08-04</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-header\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <div cl